    "solution": "public static double pow2(double base, int exponent) {\n    double result = 1.0;\n    \n    if (exponent >= 0) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < exponent; i++) {\n            result *= base;\n        }\n    } else {\n        for (int i = exponent; i < 0; i++) {\n            result *= 1 / base;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    return result;\n}",
