    "solution": "public static void printAverage(Scanner console) {\n    System.out.print(\"Type a number: \");\n    double sum = 0;\n    int num = console.nextInt();\n    int totalNum = 0;\n    \n    while (num >= 0) {\n        sum += num;\n        System.out.print(\"Type a number: \");\n        num = console.nextInt();\n        totalNum++;\n    }\n    \n    if (totalNum > 0) {\n        System.out.println(\"Average was \" + sum / totalNum);\n    }\n}",
