    "solution": "public static String toBinary(int num) {\n    String result = \"\";\n    result = num % 2 + result;\n    num /= 2;\n    \n    while (num != 0) {\n        result = num % 2 + result;\n        num /= 2;\n    }\n    \n    return result;\n}",
