    "solution": "public static int longestSortedSequence(int[] array) {\n    if (array.length == 0) {\n        return 0;\n    } else {\n        int count = 1;\n        int longest = 1;\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < array.length - 1; i++) {\n            if (array[i] <= array[i + 1]) {\n                count++;\n                if (count > longest) {\n                    longest = count;\n                }\n            } else {\n                count = 1;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        return longest;\n    }\n}",
