    "question": "Write a method stutter that takes an ArrayList of Strings and an integer\nk as parameters and that replaces every string with k copies of that string.",
    "solution": "public static void stutter(ArrayList<String> array, int k) {\n    if (k <= 0) {\n        array.clear();\n    } else {\n        int oldSize = array.size();\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < oldSize; i++) {\n            String word = array.get(i * k);\n            for (int j = 1; j < k; j++) {\n                array.add(i * k + j, word);\n            }\n        }\n        \n    }\n}",
    "hasSourceQuestion": true
