    "solution": "public static void mirrorHalves(Queue<Integer> q) {\n    if (q == null || q.size() % 2 == 1) {\n        throw new IllegalArgumentException();\n    }\n    \n    Stack<Integer> s = new Stack<Integer>();\n    int moves = q.size() / 2;\n    \n    for (int i = 0; i < 2; i++) {\n        \n        for (int k = 0; k < moves; k++) {\n            int num = q.remove();\n            s.push(num);\n            q.add(num);\n        }\n        \n        while (!s.isEmpty()) {\n            q.add(s.pop());\n        }\n    }\n}",
